00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.380
- During the six years
I worked at McKinsey,

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:05.330
I learned one question
that lots of consultants

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:08.550
use all the time in
order to lead their work

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:11.890
towards insights that are really
helpful for the companies,

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:15.290
and this is a question that
especially senior consultants,

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:17.770
such as partners or senior project leads,

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:20.800
would use in order to motivate their team,

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.480
in order to really drill
down into the insights

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:24.880
that the team generated,

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.700
and this is the question of the "So what?"

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:31.700
It's a question that is barely
used outside of consulting,

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:35.293
but in consulting, people
use it all the time.

00:00:35.293 --> 00:00:37.520
Welcome to this channel, Firm Learning.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:38.730
My name is Heinrich.

